              <lg xml:id="m-d2152fe4-9897-477d-a33a-e0f9add77e86">
                <l xml:id="m-f6aabadb-ada3-4269-a415-3313ea81f860" facs="#m-5cd7c349-b7cb-476a-b2f2-ca6b3c0180d3" label="text-like">4th Sunday of Advent.</l><l xml:id="m-39827377-6612-4c06-b7ef-a84e20ae00b6" facs="#m-99f239d8-ffe1-425b-8c02-cc9d6c8adedb" label="ambiguous">353</l><l xml:id="m-d1ab6bcc-6353-4f27-8d98-c8db2736d141" facs="#m-c9329aee-3d9c-4746-a209-5eaff1314638" label="text-like">The Fourth Sunday of Advent.</l><l xml:id="m-a43bab84-3897-4b26-ade8-ef2e99ac36ce" facs="#m-fac0a425-3ce4-49b5-aca5-c4299029feb3" label="lyrics-like">At Prime. Ant. Cánite túba. p. 356.</l><l xml:id="m-ca5930f5-83ae-43af-ae9b-0ef786c1aa90" facs="#m-dbd93fff-746f-4054-9d14-e999a00ac118" label="text-like">AT TERCE.</l><l xml:id="m-3c25b18a-1cf7-450c-9d56-b1b1fd3c1567" facs="#m-da3038ae-0355-4398-b897-600c8573b516" label="lyrics-like">Ant. Ecce véniet. p. 357. Chapter from Vespers. Fratres: Sic nos. p. 358.</l><l xml:id="m-1765abd8-fc84-47a6-97f6-702e696257e9" facs="#m-b4dec050-3955-4aa3-936a-03c8fbebd74f" label="lyrics-like">Short Resp. Véni ad liberándum nos. p. 238. V. Timébunt.</l><l xml:id="m-e607875d-f699-4280-8ae3-5b12a6530d7a" facs="#m-80e57fdf-c752-4490-8699-4abdb786070a" label="text-like">AT MASS.</l><l xml:id="m-1ccef260-ba00-4794-8cef-e1bf10817c1e" facs="#m-b1bcf9b0-544e-41d4-a6ec-203383186ff0" label="ambiguous">Intr.</l><l xml:id="m-a5d22160-70f2-43ca-bb4e-133e84a35e64" facs="#m-bc1204c3-2aa0-482e-9e0e-626f752fe79f" label="ambiguous">1.</l><l xml:id="m-74abeffd-4b9a-4b92-8f85-c0b0e379c943" facs="#m-fa041224-ce77-4a4f-a228-f3867d42b5b9" label="lyrics-like">R O-râ-te“ caé- li dé-su- per, et nú-bes plú¬ ant</l><l xml:id="m-17c0eebe-dd9b-4d0f-bf40-bc12e781bad7" facs="#m-1a1a4fd4-1e9c-47eb-9366-bc30229cad14" label="lyrics-like">jú- stum: ape-ri-á-tur tér- ra, et gérminet Salva¬</l><l xml:id="m-42468b85-182e-4e78-9047-d856c99961b1" facs="#m-726998aa-dc14-4b64-be04-83ca6e8f8096" label="lyrics-like">tó-rem. Ps. Caéli enárrant gló-ri-am Dé¬"et ópera</l><l xml:id="m-2b7d002f-b49c-46aa-9bd3-cb7cd9bcf8b9" facs="#m-748fda0b-a506-4d4d-9eef-bcbf04b1ff40" label="lyrics-like">mánu-um é-jus annúnti-at firmamén-tum. Gló-ri-a Pá¬</l><l xml:id="m-95392a20-38c2-496d-bc05-76314b899a37" facs="#m-52002ca6-4621-4a3b-8a67-78d9b3cbf5c2" label="ambiguous">tri. Eu oua e.</l><l xml:id="m-1cfa282b-8de8-498d-ba0e-ec918de0c39f" facs="#m-1bf4cd10-5ee9-4593-afc2-5f4902e60bad" label="ambiguous">Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-e4c69a76-c1fb-4484-8626-45537f850863" facs="#m-5b36e94b-20a7-469e-8727-6441f074693b" label="lyrics-like">Qxcita, quaésumus Dómine, pot- cáta praepédiunt, *indulgéntia tuae</l><l xml:id="m-bf894106-d07e-4e1e-add1-7e1e0114e10c" facs="#m-faccf159-fac4-4f5e-a530-b1f2e0383e56" label="lyrics-like">propitiatiónis accéleret: Qui vivis</l><l xml:id="m-82815bd7-6fc5-4790-bc38-65870820d43f" facs="#m-074f35e5-d311-4de3-9a53-fa601e1f7213" label="lyrics-like">Uéntiam tuam, et veni, et magna</l><l xml:id="m-545335d6-5fa6-47b2-b90b-729904b20455" facs="#m-4bc25f60-1ed1-4e17-bbb1-741c48351550" label="ambiguous">et regnas cum Deo Patre.</l><l xml:id="m-b0034d37-c847-423f-a8c2-e4684bedfaf2" facs="#m-b60d9da6-85c9-4d43-aa4e-288bef886d90" label="lyrics-like">nobis virtúte succûrre; f ut per auxi¬</l><l xml:id="m-a716ffff-db19-49e5-aceb-9c53edf6b0b9" facs="#m-34bcbe06-fbec-4d75-ab97-7e3039882838" label="lyrics-like">lium grátiae tuae, quod nostra pec¬</l><l xml:id="m-ba322929-4a72-4065-8b82-4b9d9ed0d483" facs="#m-a48a239d-ed24-4d45-b578-8fd374178dcc" label="text-like">The other Collects are as on the Ist Sunday of Advent, p. 319.</l><l xml:id="m-b87748eb-163e-44ee-8a0a-427e03f4d037" facs="#m-e2185ac2-10a8-4f3f-ab36-64f97e9c44e9" label="ambiguous">Lectio Epistolae beati Pauli Apostoli ad Corinthios. I. Cor.4.</l><l xml:id="m-ff1facb4-93a9-4287-9d70-30e3eab12d6e" facs="#m-fc2af770-c467-47bf-9835-e413f35b8fbb" label="lyrics-like">LrRatres: Sic nos exístimet homo sum: sed non in hoc justificátus</l><l xml:id="m-011a3313-a467-478e-8fbb-9b0339a3a5dd" facs="#m-01f32495-7b84-416c-ac5d-16e45e2bd524" label="ambiguous">ut ministros Christi, et dispen¬</l><l xml:id="m-87cbc3d2-37fc-436d-9290-82827237bacf" facs="#m-6f8ecea4-e112-4228-93ac-d329763eee15" label="lyrics-like">sum: qui autem júdicat me, Dómi¬</l><l xml:id="m-f2efcbac-b75c-40bb-bd52-c99fdeeb8af0" facs="#m-c23ca684-e4f1-4b9b-b112-02c2fcd43838" label="lyrics-like">satóres mysteriórum Dei. Hic jam</l><l xml:id="m-94cb692b-0240-4b20-83b3-6ce1bc9a9d65" facs="#m-ee3cfd64-aa06-4176-907a-594cf1943dab" label="lyrics-like">nus est. Itaque nolîte ante tempus</l><l xml:id="m-f211d9aa-7908-45e8-a4b9-adc88b9324ce" facs="#m-78c9860a-593a-4f5b-9ee9-fea12a1a9f86" label="lyrics-like">judicáre, quoadúsque véniat Dómi¬</l><l xml:id="m-3440d772-8645-4568-8920-aeaf3e7cc9fd" facs="#m-89cae064-8539-4296-906c-e895a5407aac" label="lyrics-like">quaéritur inter dispensatóres, ut fidé¬</l><l xml:id="m-7ea68f67-068d-49ef-9cc1-65fda4abed70" facs="#m-220b9a62-5e39-478d-baac-0711ac1fbf55" label="lyrics-like">nus qui et illuminábit abscóndita</l><l xml:id="m-c244d03d-ef57-47db-b7f6-e66d9bd3b3c5" facs="#m-b94d938a-2a95-41d8-9df2-4a7a453453ad" label="lyrics-like">tis quis inveniátur. Mihi autem pro</l><l xml:id="m-719592e9-222f-4f12-b002-01c024d300af" facs="#m-8ba4322c-6cba-4d5d-a92f-5b0dc6d9a3e6" label="lyrics-like">tenebrárum, et manifestábit consi¬</l><l xml:id="m-b03e462d-d81d-4121-801b-758f398f8892" facs="#m-d888ad0f-16ef-4567-8ec4-9b649efaefe4" label="lyrics-like">mínimo est, ut a vobis júdicer, aut</l><l xml:id="m-185354c0-e994-4e38-bf33-b7397b851d92" facs="#m-2feb2d54-252d-42de-a241-6255e48c72fd" label="lyrics-like">lia córdium : et tunc laus erit uni¬</l><l xml:id="m-4228629c-7459-4c0e-a107-88f4ee3fa3ca" facs="#m-59ca1d96-d3a3-4c57-b996-0fc01db881eb" label="lyrics-like">ab humáno die: sed neque meípsum</l><l xml:id="m-1293db30-3d8c-441b-8621-f143aa3f4e24" facs="#m-03ade0e7-1773-4165-b622-c04eec44d4fa" label="lyrics-like">júdico. Nihil enim mihi cónscius cuique a Deo.</l></lg>
